<node id="11126272" title="Re^3: is rand random enough to simulate dice rolls?" created="2021-01-04 08:20:21" updated="2021-01-04 08:20:21" _doctext_mode="strict"><type id="11">note</type>
<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;Note that you don't really need the two &lt;c&gt;ok&lt;/c&gt;'s in the &lt;c&gt;else&lt;/c&gt; since the conditions have already been tested, and in fact they may fail in case &lt;c&gt;$avg==3.4 or $avg==3.6&lt;/c&gt;. You could just do &lt;c&gt;else { pass "average randomness ok (3.4 &lt; 10000d6 / 10000 &lt; 3.6)" }&lt;/c&gt; instead.&lt;/p&gt;
</doctext>
